      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783604310034,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> Bottom of the menu is \nsingle line indicator of the \navailable actions\n\n\nThe window opens as \nfloat (horizontally center\nwidth matches to fit\nlongest title/bottom hints\npanel's string length plus\nsome \"breathing space\"\npadding of 1 char on the\nsides. Vertically it follows\nconfig (center, bottom or\ntop positioning) in relation\nto the editor window",
      "fontSize": 15.478312631359247,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> Bottom of the menu is \nsingle line indicator of the \navailable actions\n\n\nThe window opens as \nfloat (horizontally center\nwidth matches to fit\nlongest title/bottom hints\npanel's string length plus\nsome \"breathing space\"\npadding of 1 char on the\nsides. Vertically it follows\nconfig (center, bottom or\ntop positioning) in relation\nto the editor window",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
